// adjacent K32 MXFP4 records, compute exact signed dot4 products, and publish
// the integer dot plus combined scale to LDS. Lane zero then performs the 64
// F32 FMAs in increasing-K order, matching the accepted WMMA kernel's numeric
// recurrence while eliminating its M=1 -> M16 padding.
